# Save as .github/CODEOWNERS
#
# With branch protection's "Require review from Code Owners" enabled, any PR
# touching these paths cannot merge without jdjakem's review.
#
# Deliberately short: agent-instruction and agent-config files (CLAUDE.md,
# .cursorrules, etc.) are NOT listed here — they are hard-blocked outright
# by security-files-guard.yml (no PR may add or change them), so no review
# path for them needs to exist, and listing them would wrongly suggest this
# repo uses those tools.
#
# A leading '/' anchors the pattern to the repo root. This file lives in
# .github/, so it is covered by its own first rule; changing it via PR
# additionally requires jdjakem's security-change-ack label (it is in the
# guard's acknowledgeable tier).

/.github/                          @jdjakem
/.githooks/                        @jdjakem
/scripts/check_prompt_injection.py @jdjakem
